  "description": "<div class=\"tabs__nav\">\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item tabs__nav-item--active\">\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"description-tabs tabs\">\n<div class=\"tabs__nav\">\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item tabs__nav-item--active\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item\">Ingredients</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__nav-item\">Nutrition Facts</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__items-list\">\n<div class=\"tabs__item tabs__item--active\">\n<p>A deep, rich flavor that’s just as rejuvenating as the energy and nutrition it provides. This superberry is jam packed with essential nutrients and antioxidants.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__item\">\n<p>Filtered Water, Organic Coconut Water, Organic Agave, Organic Acai Flavor, Organic Lemon Juice Concentrate, Organic Vegetable Glycerin, Organic Raspberry Flavor, Sea Salt, Natural Flavors from Plants, Organic Monk Fruit Flavor, Organic Amla Fruit, Organic Sweet Potato Juice, Purple Carrot, Organic Guava, Zinc Gluconate, Organic Maqui Superberries. <b>Contains: Coconut.</b></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs__item\"><img alt=\"Berri Lyte Nutrition Facts Acai Berri\" height=\"426\" width=\"423\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2227/4617/files/Berri-Lyte_NutritionFacts-Acai.jpg?v=1595367801\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
